    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d242">

                <pb facs="0435" n="303" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg303"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 PW/7–1445: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 242<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">u. s. urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-14T12:00:00-04:00">July 14,
                            1945—noon.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5773. Ital Ambassador has informed Dept
                    Italy has declared war against Japan and that declaration will be made public
                    July 15. Dept therefore proposes to announce on
                    July 17 this Govt’s intention to support officially Italy’s admission in due course to world security
                    organization.</p>
                <p>Inform Foreign Office urgently of Dept’s
                    intention and express hope that British Govt will support American position.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
